+- **Per-release users.** HelmCharts `terraform-modules/s3-storage` wraps the provider's `homelab_s3_storage`: one RGW user named after the release namespace (`<chart>-<stage>`), owning exactly the release's buckets, with `max_buckets = -1` so it can never create another. Its keys go into the Terraform-written Secret `s3-credentials` in the release namespace; OpenBao holds no copy. Rotation is per release (`key_rotation`), so blast radius bounds itself. The user follows the namespace, not the cluster: the prd cluster hosts every stage, and each stage's release has its own user.
